        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
        <rdfs:comment>참여자 확인 여부 — 발송했다고 전달된 것은 아니다. 발달장애인 대상 사업이라면 확인 여부까지 봐야 한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>boolean</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/notification_notificationId">
        <rdfs:label>결과 통지 식별자</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Notification"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>결과 통지 식별자 — 고유 식별자. SQL 의 id UUID PRIMARY KEY 에 대응한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:isIdentifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ont:isIdentifier>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/appeal_appealFiledOn">
        <rdfs:label>이의신청일</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Appeal"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
        <rdfs:comment>이의신청일</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>date</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/appeal_appealGround">
        <rdfs:label>이의 사유</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Appeal"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>이의 사유</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/appeal_appealFiledBySelf">
        <rdfs:label>본인 제기 여부</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Appeal"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
        <rdfs:comment>본인 제기 여부</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>boolean</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/appeal_appealDueOn">
        <rdfs:label>처리 기한</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Appeal"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
        <rdfs:comment>처리 기한 — 확인된 자료상 접수 후 14일 이내 처리·재통보. ⚠️ 서울형 적용 여부 기관 확인 필요. 상수로 박지 말고 차수별 설정값으로 둔다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>date</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/appeal_appealOutcome">
        <rdfs:label>이의신청 결과</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Appeal"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>이의신청 결과 — pending | upheld(인용) | partially_upheld(일부 인용) | dismissed(기각)</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/appeal_appealId">
        <rdfs:label>이의신청 식별자</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Appeal"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>이의신청 식별자 — 고유 식별자. SQL 의 id UUID PRIMARY KEY 에 대응한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:isIdentifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ont:isIdentifier>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/budgetAllocation_totalCeiling">
        <rdfs:label>총 한도액</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/BudgetAllocation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment>총 한도액 — 확인된 자료상 240만원(1·2차). 차수별로 다르므로 행에 저장한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>decimal</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/budgetAllocation_monthlyCeiling">
        <rdfs:label>월 한도액</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/BudgetAllocation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment>월 한도액 — 확인된 자료상 40만원(2025년 40~50만원).</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>decimal</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/budgetAllocation_periodMonths">
        <rdfs:label>지원 개월수</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/BudgetAllocation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
        <rdfs:comment>지원 개월수</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>integer</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/budgetAllocation_carryOverAllowed">
        <rdfs:label>이월 허용 여부</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/BudgetAllocation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean"/>
        <rdfs:comment>이월 허용 여부 — ⚠️ 월 미사용액을 다음 달로 넘길 수 있는지는 확인되지 않았다. 총 한도 내 사용 가능하다는 서술이 있으나 명확한 규정 확인 필요 — 기관 확인 항목. 잔액 계산 로직이 이 값에 따라 완전히 달라진다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>boolean</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/budgetAllocation_allocatedAmount">
        <rdfs:label>배정 확정액</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/BudgetAllocation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment>배정 확정액</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>decimal</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/budgetAllocation_budgetAllocationId">
        <rdfs:label>예산 배정 식별자</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/BudgetAllocation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>예산 배정 식별자 — 고유 식별자. SQL 의 id UUID PRIMARY KEY 에 대응한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:isIdentifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ont:isIdentifier>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/serviceUsage_usageDate">
        <rdfs:label>이용일</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ServiceUsage"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
        <rdfs:comment>이용일</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>date</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/serviceUsage_usageAmount">
        <rdfs:label>이용 금액</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ServiceUsage"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment>이용 금액</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>decimal</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/serviceUsage_usageDescription">
        <rdfs:label>이용 내용</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ServiceUsage"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>이용 내용</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/serviceUsage_decidedBySelf">
        <rdfs:label>결정 주체</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ServiceUsage"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>결정 주체 — self | self_with_support | suggested_accepted | by_supporter. ★ 입력자(creator)와 결정자를 구분한다. 실무자가 대신 입력한 것과 실무자가 대신 결정한 것은 전혀 다르다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/serviceUsage_settlementStatus">
        <rdfs:label>정산 상태</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ServiceUsage"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>정산 상태 — pending(검토대기) | accepted(인정) | rejected(불인정) | recovered(환수)</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/serviceUsage_serviceUsageId">
        <rdfs:label>서비스 이용 식별자</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ServiceUsage"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>서비스 이용 식별자 — 고유 식별자. SQL 의 id UUID PRIMARY KEY 에 대응한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:isIdentifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ont:isIdentifier>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/receipt_receiptStoragePath">
        <rdfs:label>영수증 저장 경로</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Receipt"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>영수증 저장 경로 — private 버킷 경로. 공개 URL 이 아니라 경로를 저장하고 조회 시 signed URL 을 생성한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/receipt_receiptIssuedOn">
        <rdfs:label>영수증 발행일</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Receipt"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
        <rdfs:comment>영수증 발행일</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>date</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/receipt_receiptAmount">
        <rdfs:label>영수증 금액</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Receipt"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment>영수증 금액 — 이용 금액과 불일치하면 정산 검토 대상이 된다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>decimal</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/receipt_receiptId">
        <rdfs:label>영수증 식별자</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Receipt"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>영수증 식별자 — 고유 식별자. SQL 의 id UUID PRIMARY KEY 에 대응한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:isIdentifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ont:isIdentifier>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/serviceProvider_providerName">
        <rdfs:label>제공처 이름</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ServiceProvider"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>제공처 이름</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/serviceProvider_businessNumber">
        <rdfs:label>사업자등록번호</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ServiceProvider"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>사업자등록번호</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/serviceProvider_serviceProviderId">
        <rdfs:label>서비스 제공처 식별자</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ServiceProvider"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>서비스 제공처 식별자 — 고유 식별자. SQL 의 id UUID PRIMARY KEY 에 대응한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:isIdentifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ont:isIdentifier>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/spendingRule_ruleKind">
        <rdfs:label>규칙 종류</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/SpendingRule"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>규칙 종류 — prohibition(금지 — 시스템 차단) | criterion(요건 — 사람 판단). ★ 이 한 컬럼이 자동화 경계선이다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/spendingRule_ruleLabel">
        <rdfs:label>규칙 이름</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/SpendingRule"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>규칙 이름</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/spendingRule_ruleSourceNote">
        <rdfs:label>근거</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/SpendingRule"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>근거 — 어느 지침 몇 조에서 온 규칙인지. 근거 없는 규칙은 이의신청에서 무너진다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/spendingRule_ruleEnforcement">
        <rdfs:label>적용 방식</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/SpendingRule"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>적용 방식 — block(저장 차단) | warn(경고 후 진행 가능) | flag(기록만, 검토 목록에 노출)</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/spendingRule_spendingRuleId">
        <rdfs:label>지출 규칙 식별자</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/SpendingRule"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>지출 규칙 식별자 — 고유 식별자. SQL 의 id UUID PRIMARY KEY 에 대응한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:isIdentifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ont:isIdentifier>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ruleCheck_checkResult">
        <rdfs:label>검증 결과</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/RuleCheck"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>검증 결과 — pass | blocked | needs_review</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ruleCheck_humanDecision">
        <rdfs:label>실무자 최종 판단</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/RuleCheck"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>실무자 최종 판단 — accepted | rejected | pending. ★ 시스템 판정과 사람 판단을 다른 컬럼에 둔다. 같은 칸에 쓰면 누가 정했는지 사라진다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ruleCheck_humanDecisionReason">
        <rdfs:label>판단 사유</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/RuleCheck"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>판단 사유</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/ruleCheck_ruleCheckId">
