        <ont:propertyType>decimal</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/settlement_recoveredAmount">
        <rdfs:label>환수액</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Settlement"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment>환수액</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>decimal</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/settlement_unusedAmount">
        <rdfs:label>미사용액</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Settlement"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
        <rdfs:comment>미사용액 — ★ 미사용은 실패가 아니다. 다만 &quot;쓸 곳을 못 찾아서&quot;인지 &quot;필요가 없어서&quot;인지는 다른 이야기이므로 모니터링 기록과 함께 읽어야 한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>decimal</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/settlement_settlementId">
        <rdfs:label>정산 식별자</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/Settlement"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>정산 식별자 — 고유 식별자. SQL 의 id UUID PRIMARY KEY 에 대응한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:isIdentifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ont:isIdentifier>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/monitoringRecord_monitoringDate">
        <rdfs:label>모니터링 일자</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/MonitoringRecord"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
        <rdfs:comment>모니터링 일자</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>date</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/monitoringRecord_monitoringMethod">
        <rdfs:label>확인 방법</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/MonitoringRecord"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>확인 방법 — visit(방문) | phone(전화) | app(앱 기록 확인) | document(서류)</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/monitoringRecord_observedChange">
        <rdfs:label>관찰된 변화</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/MonitoringRecord"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>관찰된 변화 — ★ 서울형에는 4+1 같은 정형 평가가 없다. 성과평가에 쓸 변화 기록은 사실상 여기뿐이므로 자유 서술이라도 반드시 남긴다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/monitoringRecord_participantVoice">
        <rdfs:label>참여자가 한 말</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/MonitoringRecord"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>참여자가 한 말 — 실무자의 관찰과 당사자 본인의 말을 다른 칸에 적는다. 섞으면 누구의 평가인지 사라진다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/monitoringRecord_monitoringRecordId">
        <rdfs:label>모니터링 기록 식별자</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/MonitoringRecord"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>모니터링 기록 식별자 — 고유 식별자. SQL 의 id UUID PRIMARY KEY 에 대응한다.</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:isIdentifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</ont:isIdentifier>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/administeringBody_bodyName">
        <rdfs:label>기관명</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/AdministeringBody"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>기관명</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/administeringBody_bodyRole">
        <rdfs:label>역할</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/AdministeringBody"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
        <rdfs:comment>역할 — city(서울시) | district(자치구) | foundation(한국장애인재단)</rdfs:comment>
        <ont:propertyType>string</ont:propertyType>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://example.org/ontology/seoul-personal-budget-scheme-ontology/administeringBody_administeringBodyId">
